  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "Three notes, stacked in thirds",
      "body": [
        "A triad is a root, a third above it and a fifth above it. What changes the sound is whether the thirds are major or minor.",
        "A major triad is a major third plus a minor third. A minor triad is a minor third plus a major third."
      ],
